      "content": "Which one of the following alkenes when\ntreated with HCl yields majorly an anti\nMarkovnikov product?",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "Cl – CH = CH<sub>2</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "F<sub>3</sub>C – CH = CH<sub>2</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "CH<sub>3</sub>O – CH = CH<sub>2</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "H<sub>2</sub>N – CH = CH<sub>2</sub>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "Markovnikov rule says negative part of the reagent attacks on the carbon of the double bond which have less number of hydrogen atom.\n<br><br>So in Anti-Markovnikov rule negative part of the reagent attacks on the carbon of the double bond which have more number of hydrogen atom.\n<picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-320w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-500w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-680w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 860px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-860w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1040px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-1040w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1220px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-1220w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1400px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-1400w.jpg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk097havf/09bfd5df-5165-48ea-a766-4bbe1a8cc6fd/233871b0-d13e-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk097havg-1580w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Evening Slot Chemistr